    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">2-D DP</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid paths</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/minimum-path-sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 64</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Minimum Path Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">With only right and down moves, the cheapest way into a cell must come through the cell above or the cell to its left, so best[r][c] = grid[r][c] + min(best[r-1][c], best[r][c-1]). Fill the table row by row; one rolling row is enough: O(m·n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
  },
